      "writtenOn": "2022-06-27T20:30:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The assert on the previous line checks that the code snippet ID is either unregistered, or registered to a matching runtime effect.\n\nIn release we way are better off doing `set` instead of `find` followed by a likely `set`.",
      "parentUuid": "b544b958_48733e5b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 85,
